      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel overwhelmed when the patterns seem so ingrained, but please hear this: you are not defined by your family's history. The feeling that ending things is the only way to protect your children is a sign of immense pain, not a solution. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out to a crisis hotline immediately; they are there to help you through this moment. You deserve support, and there are people who want to help you find a way forward.",
